{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2022-07-07 09:27:00', 'title': 'LMC ANNOUNCES START OF LEASING AT THE EMERY', 'text': '500 APARTMENT HOMES AVAILABLE AT THE GATEWAY TO THE BAY AREA EMERYVILLE, CALIF. , JULY 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LMC , A LEADER IN APARTMENT DEVELOPMENT AND MANAGEMENT, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE START OF LEASING AT ITS NEWEST COMMUNITY, THE EMERY , AT THE GATEWAY TO THE BAY AREA IN EMERYVILLE, CALIF.'}